==History==
2024
*The Wizard Trio card was made available in the Wizard Trio Event on 27/5/2024.
*On 3/6/2024, the Wizard Trio was removed from the game.
*On 19/8/2024, the Wizard Trio was readded to the game in the Super Cards Draft Event.
*On 26/8/2024, the Wizard Trio was removed from the game.
2025
*On 27/1/2025, the Wizard Trio was readded to the game in the Super Cards Draft Event.
*On 3/2/2025, the Wizard Trio was removed from the game.
*On 16/6/2025, the Wizard Trio was readded to the game in the Wizard Trio Event.
*On 23/6/2025, the Wizard Trio was removed from the game.

==Trivia==
*The word "''Wizard''" comes from the Middle English "''wys''", meaning wise.
*Electricity was first detected through electric fish from as far back as 2750 BCE where Ancient Egyptian texts described them as the "protectors" of all other fish. At around 600 BCE, Thales of Miletus made a series of observations on static electricity, from which he believed that friction rendered amber magnetic, in contrast to minerals such as magnetite, which needed no rubbing. Thales was incorrect in believing the attraction was due to a magnetic effect, but later science would prove a link between magnetism and electricity. Electricity would remain little more than an intellectual curiosity for millennia until 1600, when the English scientist William Gilbert wrote ''De Magnete'', in which he made a careful study of electricity and magnetism, distinguishing the lodestone effect from static electricity produced by rubbing amber.
**The Wizard Trio is 1 of 11 cards associated with electricity, with the others being [[Electro Spirit]], [[Zap]], [[Tesla]], [[Zappies]], [[Electro Dragon]], [[Electro Giant]], [[Lightning]], [[Electro Wizard]], [[Sparky]], and the [[Goblinstein]].
*The Wizard Trio is 1 of 7 [[cards]] associated with ice, with the others being [[Ice Spirit]], [[Giant Snowball]], [[Ice Golem]], [[Freeze]], [[Ice Wizard]], and [[Super Ice Golem]].
*It is 1 of 4 cards that spawns different [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] at once, the others being [[Goblin Gang]], [[Rascals]], and the Goblinstein.
**It spawns the most unique troops out of all cards that spawn different troops at once, spawning a total of 3 troops.
*Along with the [[Skeletons]] and [[Skeleton Army]], the Wizard Trio are the only swarm card whose members spawn all at the exact same time.
*The Wizard Trio is 1 of 2 "value pack" troop card that has a different rarity with its corresponding "basic" troop card, the other being Skeleton Army (the [[Wizard]] is a {{Rarity|Rare}} card while the Wizard Trio is a {{Rarity|Legendary}} card).

